

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Dastur xotira-boshqaruvi: 0.

Chiqish yozish: (6 < 5), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (2 > 1), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (2 ≤ 1), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (9 ≥ 1), yangi-qator.
