Chiqish yozish: (-2 manfiy?), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ((3 ≥ 4) & (3 ≤ 5)), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (3 = 3), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (3 ≠ 3), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: 1 mantiqiy, yangi-qator.

Dastur tozalash.

